#: section-%3E[0]-%3Econtent-%3Elist-%3E[0]-%3Edescription
msgid ""
"The **Fedora Workstation** tag on Fedora's Discourse-based discussion forum "
"is a great place to connect with other Fedora Workstation users and "
"contributors."
msgstr ""

#: section-%3E[0]-%3Econtent-%3Elist-%3E[1]-%3Etitle
msgid "Chat"
msgstr ""

#: section-%3E[0]-%3Econtent-%3Elist-%3E[1]-%3Edescription
msgid ""
"You can chat with the Fedora Workstation Working Group via either Matrix or "
"IRC: **\\#workstation:fedoraproject.org** on Matrix and **\\#fedora-"
"workstation** on irc.libera.chat."
msgstr ""

